      "id": "cancel-squared-factor",
      "title": "Cancel a squared factor",
      "explanation": "The difference is \\(2112-2021=91=7\\cdot13\\), and the denominator is \\(169=13^2\\). Thus the common squared factor cancels:\n\\[\n\\frac{(2112-2021)^2}{169}\n=\\frac{(7\\cdot13)^2}{13^2}\n=\\frac{7^2\\cdot13^2}{13^2}\n=7^2=\\boxed{49}.\n\\]\nThe answer is choice \\(\\text{(C)}\\).",
      "directNodeIds": [
